This repository is a deployment wrapper around:

  - sergqwer/strata-nvfp4 (the Strata NVFP4 fork) — see its license in
    third_party/llama.cpp/ (or upstream)

  - ggerganov/llama.cpp at commit 3cf0325 (in third_party/llama.cpp/) —
    MIT License. See third_party/llama.cpp/LICENSE.

  - The Qwen3.8-Flash-Next NVFP4 model (Maximilian228/...) — Qwen Community
    License 1.0. Not redistributed in this repo; downloaded on first run via
    setup.py.
